		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>No Action Cost</strong> - 1 Creature (30 ft.) - 1 Minute - Magical - 1/Short Rest</p><p><em>Trigger: A creature tries to move away from you.</em></p><p><strong>Wisdom Save</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> Target takes 4d6 psychic damage and is &amp;reference[charmed] and &amp;reference[goaded] by you. Target rolls another save at the end of each of their turns (including this one if applicable), ending the effect on a success.</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> Half damage, no other effect.</p></li></ul>",
